doc:FactsDesignDetail1_2 None:has_text_value "Stage 1: component-specific Remaining Useful Life (RUL) prediction using Long Short-Term Memory (LSTM) models; WGAN-GP (Wasserstein GAN with gradient penalty) for run-to-failure data augmentation to address failure-data sparsity. Stage 2: cluster components by RUL degradation using DBSCAN to enable opportunistic maintenance; optimize maintenance decisions via a cost-aware grid search on fitted RUL distributions and a risk proxy." .
_:e5e8a6626b07ab28905ec02c91b7468d rdf:reifies <<( doc:FactsDesignDetail1_2 None:has_text_value "Stage 1: component-specific Remaining Useful Life (RUL) prediction using Long Short-Term Memory (LSTM) models; WGAN-GP (Wasserstein GAN with gradient penalty) for run-to-failure data augmentation to address failure-data sparsity. Stage 2: cluster components by RUL degradation using DBSCAN to enable opportunistic maintenance; optimize maintenance decisions via a cost-aware grid search on fitted RUL distributions and a risk proxy." )>> ;
